# The only image built from this repo is the public site (website/Dockerfile),
# and its context is the repo root so it can read the shared guides/. Allowlist:
# everything is excluded except the two folders that build needs.
*
!website
!guides

website/node_modules
website/dist
website/preview
website/demo/workspace
website/scripts
website/**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
